---
kind: scene
id: spine.elite.drakon
title: The Elite Four — Drakon
on: challenge
target: arena.dragonChamber
once: false
when: "@badgeCount >= 8 && holds('defeated', ['morwen']) && !holds('defeated', ['drakon'])"
---

## The chamber

::bg{location="dragonChamber" time="day"}
::actor{character="drakon" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@drakon{code="0010"}: I am Drakon, last of the Four. Dragons are the oldest monsters of all. Here, they are mine.
::music{playback="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
::battle{foe="drakon" kind="elite" resultKey="fight"}
<match subject="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    @drakon{code="0020"}: Beaten. By a trainer who is not yet grown. The Champion's hall is open to you.
    ::assert{defeated(drakon)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @drakon{code="0030"}: The dragons win. As they always have.
    // the streak breaks: the whole Four must be beaten again
    ::retract{defeated(frostine)}
    ::retract{defeated(tarrok)}
    ::retract{defeated(morwen)}
    ::retract{defeated(drakon)}
  </otherwise>
</match>
